 ### To activate the chromosomal structure variation analysis, first create a conda environment with conda installation as follows:

## Download the latest Anaconda .sh file:

bash Anaconda3-2022.10-Linux-x86_64.sh

## Follow the onscript instruction and reset the terminal by closing and opening again, then:

conda list 			# Checks the installation of packages
conda init fish			# Initialize fish shell
conda update conda		# Update packages in conda

## To add bioconda channel:

conda config --add channels bioconda

## Generate the environment for your task:

conda create -n structural
conda activate structural

## Install delly and wally:

conda install delly
conda install wally

## Structural variation call on short-read paired-end sequence data (https://bpa-csiro-workshops.github.io/btp-manuals-md/modules/cancer-module-sv/sv_tut/)

delly call -g Refgen/PlasmoDB-57_Pfalciparum3D7_Genome.fasta 0815.Plasmodium.INPUT.MAPQfiltered.dedup_deleted.bam > 3d7.structural.rearrangement.vcf

delly call -t BND -g Refgen/PlasmoDB-57_Pfalciparum3D7_Genome.fasta 0815.Plasmodium.INPUT.MAPQfiltered.dedup_deleted.bam > 3d7.interchrom.vcf

## bcf/vcf - variation call form can be used in IGV to check locations

